<section class="lede-section">
  <h2>// working principles</h2>
  <div class="principle-grid">
    <p><strong>Use real inputs.</strong><br />A smaller honest product is more useful than a polished fictional demo.</p>
    <p><strong>Show the gaps.</strong><br />Missing data, uncertainty, and trade-offs should be visible—not hidden.</p>
    <p><strong>Keep the path clear.</strong><br />Every screen should help someone understand what to do next.</p>
  </div>
</section>
